Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.79,0:00:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）还没来吗～真是的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么还不快点来啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也太慢了吧～。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.19,0:00:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）到底从今天早上开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在等什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是那个东西啊，那个东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（喇叭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了来了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，等一下……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等……等等我～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂喂，喂喂。有没有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.69,0:00:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要送到我家的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.75,0:00:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄给九十九游马的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.11,0:00:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马？我看看～{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九 九十九 九十九……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.86,0:00:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄给九十九游马先生的邮件一封都没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.11,0:00:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（乌鸦叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.19,0:01:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（门铃）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）哟！委员长！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}过得还好吗～？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.23,0:01:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）等一下～
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一大早就这么兴奋过头了吧～。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.93,0:01:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.14,0:01:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是有什么好事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然有啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个！这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要开始了哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.89,0:01:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园主办的世界级决斗大会！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它的预选赛终于要从明天开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冠军奖品是心园的终身免费通行证和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.33,0:01:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}初代决斗冠军的称号！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）然后然后　重头戏是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园先生会实现优胜者的愿望{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管什么　都只限一个说是会帮你实现的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.94,0:01:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我　赢了的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.46,0:01:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让他把能实现的愿望增加到100个的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我觉得那不行吧…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《凯西：如果我　赢了的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就和游马君…》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.93,0:01:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家　都要参加吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:01:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.46,0:02:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？　那个。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.65,0:02:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片。　心的碎片的说法。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是　通往决斗嘉年华的通行证的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.53,0:02:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也要！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.01,0:02:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）我也要！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.05,0:02:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都有呢～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.41,0:02:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游……游马君，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没有……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.83,0:02:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）哎？没有什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.19,0:02:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么……{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么只有我心之碎片不来啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.26,0:02:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 可恶 可恶 可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.14,0:02:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 哼 哼 哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你是不想参加
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是不想 是参加不了啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.37,0:02:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 为什么只有游马那里不来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真奇怪～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 你没说什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我觉得是游马那笨蛋的错。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反正我啊，就算说是决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也没人这么觉得啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.17,0:02:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你有好好报名吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎，报什么名！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:03:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说，就是决斗嘉年华的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}参加报名啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有那种东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看看这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想参加的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}点这里，然后报名…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片…不是所有决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都会发的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全世界的决斗者都会来参加的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.01,0:03:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是冒冒失失的～。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}稍微想一想就明白了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直就是你决斗的写照啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.87,0:03:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之 现在先报名不就好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.89,0:03:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 就这么办！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.24,0:03:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住址 姓名…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 好 我知道啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）报名申请
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经 截止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）感谢大家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}踊跃报名！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你要去哪里啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:04:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）你这家伙在这种地方跑什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了决斗嘉年华在跑步啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是老样子，真是个让人无法理解的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，你也要参加吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，都到这时候了我对站在台前的名誉没兴趣。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会以我自己的方式去面对决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那再见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.09,0:04:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）好久不见了　凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）不　还是叫你鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.55,0:05:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比较好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙　到底是想干什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是打个招呼而已哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗嘉年华开始之前呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会　参加大会的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.13,0:05:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀哎呀。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你还在对那时候的事耿耿于怀呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么　就让我来说个有趣的故事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那场决赛{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在休息室里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.37,0:05:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}偷看我的卡组而被判了失格。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是　那时候的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在正常的精神状态下是不可能的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亲眼目睹了重要的人遭遇不幸的事故。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（机械音）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.11,0:05:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙，你一定要夺冠。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对于那种状态下的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果对战对手故意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把卡组弄散的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，她的事故如果不是偶然的话？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了陷害我……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可以动用暴力。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈……！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.23,0:06:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，真是可笑呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为那件事，你被逐出决斗的正式舞台。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而我现在则是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}极东地区的决斗冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.73,0:06:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差距可真是拉大了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很不甘心吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就来打倒我试试啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗嘉年华上！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我等着你。哈哈哈哈…！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.55,0:06:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗嘉年华…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）啊哈哈哈哈…！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如你所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.65,0:08:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙会参加决斗嘉年华的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.67,0:08:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可真是。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.11,0:08:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是辛苦您了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）但是 为什么要在意那种家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 早就已经作为决斗者只剩一副空壳了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.43,0:08:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈哈哈哈…！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此，那也是必要的呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等我们把 No.卡全部收集齐的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，算了。这样一来，把那家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次推入地狱的乐趣就有了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵……哈哈哈哈……！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那你就想想办法嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我都这样跑到心园来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.03,0:09:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们这边也实在无能为力。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我才说你想想办法嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.59,0:09:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不参加决斗嘉年华的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}体质上就会死掉的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.10,0:09:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊……你看你看，脉搏。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，不行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行了，要死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要死了 要死了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天真是 谢谢您了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交出来！把心之碎片给我交出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:09:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直像个烦人的醉鬼呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在为您播报719号航班以及441号航班的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}登机手续尚未办理的乘客{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请前往值机柜台…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之大陆城人口增长率
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目前为158%。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正以每小时5%的速度增长中。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈修）来了来了来了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兴致满满地来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了决斗嘉年华！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多罗瓦）各区域 有无异常？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.05,0:10:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全区域监控摄像头运作正常。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}网络通信 无异常。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:11:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各交通网机器人运转率正常。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好燃啊！热血沸腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你兴奋个什么劲啊，高修。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们运营委员的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是监视决斗嘉年华。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时刻保持冷静。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切，真是个没劲的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过话说回来，德罗瓦让你这种冷血女{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兴奋起来，也确实强人所难了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.15,0:11:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不能起争执。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟准备工作正在稳步推进。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！我等你很久了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.16,0:11:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）把我叫到这种地方有什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.86,0:11:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么叫来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想在嘉年华开始之前，让你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看看这幅景象。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这座心园市，现在为了嘉年华{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大量的决斗者正聚集于此。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然，在这些决斗者当中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.35,0:11:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有 No.卡的人想必也有吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场嘉年华中脱颖而出{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:12:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就意味着从那些决斗者手中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将 No.卡夺过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.95,0:12:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，别大意了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据情报，各地的强豪都会参战。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（权现坂）嘛，放轻松点吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是不行的话，到时候就由我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来帮你收集 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管谁来都不是我的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.95,0:12:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是快斗大人，真让人安心。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.91,0:12:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住口，权现坂。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.67,0:12:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大门前有个少年说要参加资格……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把他赶回去。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.24,0:12:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他说在拿到心之碎片之前不会回去。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}像个烦人的醉汉一样的少年。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.14,0:12:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}醉汉？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.23,0:12:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一生的请求！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我心之碎片啊 心之碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这家伙……》赶紧把他赶回去！是。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 给他参加资格吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你认识他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 他有可能持有 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:13:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 你是不是有什么事瞒着我。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前几天 心园的设施引发了神秘的爆炸。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只是机器误作动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要收集 No.卡应该就没意见了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的行动没有逐一向你报告的义务。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.01,0:13:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）快斗大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与九十九游马的那件事不报告吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别多嘴。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵、遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《如果说我有敌人的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙我一定会打倒。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说你把九十九游马当对手？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.98,0:13:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马是…？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.29,0:13:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是个笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在拿到心之碎片之前绝对不回去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭这样真的能拿到心之碎片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁知道呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.75,0:14:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，那个人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是本尊耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大、大叔！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.25,0:14:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马真是的……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是心园先生大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对对，心园！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.31,0:14:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对、心园先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……你看，怎么说呢{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华的告知画面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.43,0:14:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着很不方便吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很不方便啊……都说了很不方便嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以啊，参加报名的那个点击
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就不小心看漏了……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，死不认账啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就不能坦率地说一句“我不小心疏忽了”吗～。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:14:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无需多言{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的愿望已经传达到了我炽热的心中。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的愿望，就由我来实现吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是……心之碎片。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我做到了，太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……那个吊坠……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.31,0:15:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}形状真少见呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个，是老爸和老妈的遗物。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.02,0:15:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遗物…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那条项链…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.07,0:15:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我好像在哪里见过…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.53,0:15:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于 和爸爸的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到了该实现的时候了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为决斗冠军的那个约定。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要 夺冠啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是这种规模的大会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.67,0:15:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有 No.卡的人应该会有很多 参加…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:16:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要能回收那些 No.卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。 这样一来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.26,0:16:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的记忆也…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过啊 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 对这次大会没打算 执着于获胜。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.19,0:16:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思？ 这样的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要完成和父亲的约定跟这件事是矛盾的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，一直在想。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.11,0:16:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我来说决斗到底是什么呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.64,0:16:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自从遇见你之后一直输个不停的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变得连强敌都能打赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且和鲨鱼还有快斗决斗的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}输了就会失去某些东西这件事我也第一次明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是不管什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我都没有讨厌过决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.11,0:16:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我来说，决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟输赢没有关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然这很难说清楚……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我来说，决斗就是羁绊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.41,0:16:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}羁绊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我决斗是想和大家保持羁绊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里没有胜也没有负。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.49,0:17:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗这件事和胜负是两码事。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.86,0:17:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗和胜负是两码事……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.39,0:17:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 如果输了我就会消失……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.91,0:17:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的想法 我难以接受。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的心情 我很清楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是为了救你我什么都愿意做。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我 明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗之中有着超越胜负的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那前方 有着比胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更加 重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 快斗会怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。他根本不会管你的信条如何{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会来向你发起决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.67,0:17:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.73,0:17:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.87,0:17:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实，要是输了，我也许会被抽走灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我的决斗不会改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那家伙战斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.47,0:17:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是游马被抽走了灵魂……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.01,0:17:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.70,0:17:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂、喂！没事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.21,0:17:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能输给那种家伙。我会赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:17:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会赢的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.87,0:18:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会赢给你看的～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.28,0:18:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得也是呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反正游马他就算劝也劝不住的……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.33,0:18:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还有星光体在呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.53,0:18:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过作为交换既然你要出场{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.22,0:18:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就绝对要拿冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.89,0:18:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听明白了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.09,0:18:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好……好的～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《比起胜负更重要的东西》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.61,0:18:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～这个和这个这样配……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～好难抉择啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.33,0:18:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家现在是不是也在组卡组呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:20:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于要开始了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.30,0:20:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（礼二）哦哦 手都痒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（刚）既然这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.35,0:20:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用大阪大妈的力量夺冠啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说 真麻君老妈要是夺冠了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给你买条百慕大短裤。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.76,0:20:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为啥啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真麻君是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.47,0:20:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）聚集在心园都市的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗者同胞们。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来 就决斗狂欢节的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.23,0:20:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}规则进行说明。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.04,0:20:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会场为 整个心园都市。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.90,0:20:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}期间为 从今天起三天作为预选赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}参加者 被挑战的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.61,0:20:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须接受。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.99,0:20:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗中赌上的是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诸位手中的心之碎片。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.37,0:21:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去它的人就在那一刻被淘汰。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要晋级决赛大会必须集齐5个心之碎片{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.77,0:21:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其完成，这是条件！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 在此
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我宣布决斗嘉年华开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们 决斗者就用火热的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把心园燃烧殆尽吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.39,0:21:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.25,0:21:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欢呼）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.81,0:21:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～ 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 绝对 要赢到最后！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.87,0:21:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也去 乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 都干劲十足呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.91,0:21:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.56,0:21:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不能输啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（卡凯鲁）让开让开让开～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.31,0:21:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一个对手是让我的朋友来决定！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.63,0:21:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你呀 很危险的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:22:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这种地方踢什么球啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.33,0:22:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（卡凯尔）决定了！我的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.79,0:22:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首战 对手就是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.38,0:22:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.06,0:22:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.01,0:24:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不只是可爱还是可靠的伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.75,0:24:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用超强力的效果让对手吃尽苦头！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.84,0:24:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的王牌怪兽 漂亮地拿下了第1名！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.37,0:24:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家感谢大量的投票！

